                  <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">$$$$</td>
                </tr>
              </tbody>
            </table>
          </div>

          <p>
            The practical rule from our season of testing: <strong>if your lawn is open to the sky, buy RTK GPS.</strong> If it is under mature tree canopy, boundary wire remains the more reliable choice despite the installation effort. Vision systems are worth the premium specifically when obstacle avoidance matters — pets, children's toys, or a yard where things get left out.
          </p>
        </div>

