            4. Matching a Robot Mower to Your Lawn
          </h2>

          <p>
            Manufacturers publish a maximum lawn area, and that number assumes ideal conditions — open ground, few obstacles, and running most days. Real yards reduce it.
          </p>

          <div class="overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl my-8">
            <table class="w-full text-left">
              <thead class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-200">
